  "verseCount": 49,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogwancha kwa Nyasae na ogosaria kwa Mwanyabaanto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria ikomi, omotienyi o gatano, omwaka o gatano na kabere, abagaaka bande b’Abaisraeli bagaacha koboria amang’ana korwa ase Omonene, bagaikaransa ase obosio bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha asende, riganteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, kwana n’abagaaka abwo b’Abaisraeli, obateebie ng’a aya naro Omonene Nyasae agoteeba: Inee! Nigo mwachire koboria momanye amang’ana korwa asende? Ekeene, buna inche inde moyo, tingwancha mborigwe amang’ana nainwe. Ninche Omonene natebire ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, Inee, noganetie kobanachera ekiina? Aye nobanachere ekiina? Onye naboigo rirorio bamanyie ogokora kw’okogechia gwe chisokoro chiabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obateebie ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Ase rituko riria nachorete Abaisraeli, nigo nariete eira y’ogotiana ase ororeria rwa Yakobo, nkeorokia na kwemanyekania ase bare, agwo ase ense ya Misiri. Nigo natianete ase bare, ngateeba: Inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko riria nigo natianete ase bare, nkabateebia ng’a nimbarusie korwa ase ense ya Misiri, mbaire ase ense konya nabanyoreire, ense entenenku ere namabeere na amooke, ense ere nobonene goetania chinse chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabateebia iga: Kera oyomo oino tiga atugute korwa ase are ebinto bi’okogechia ebio anchete korigereria, timobaisa gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka ase engencho y’emegwekano eyio Abamisiri bagosasiima. Inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abanto abwo bagasaria asende, bakaanga konyigwera. Nonya noyomo tatugutete ebinto ebio bi’okogechia banchete korigereria, gose onde tatigete emegwekano eyio Abaisraeli barenge gosasiima. Erio nkarengereria kobaumorera endamwamu y’ane, agwo ase ense ya Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ayio nakorete nigo nayakorete ase okorenda erieta riane tirikorwa ribe eritachenegeti nebisaku ebio Abaisraeli bamenyete ase egati yabo. Ase amasio y’ebisaku ebio inemanyekanetie ase Abaisraeli ase okobarusia ase ense ya Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio nkabarusia korwa ase ense ya Misiri, nkabarenta ase erooro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ’nkabaa emeroberio y’ane echiikire, na nkaborokereria amachiiko ane, na omonto orayabwate nabe moyo goetera asaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ’nkabaa Chisabato chiane chikaba ekemanyererio ase egati y’ane na barabwo, erio banyare komanya ng’a ninche Omonene nkobachena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Abaisraeli bagasaria asende, agwo ase erooro; tibabwatetie emeroberio y’ane echiikire, korende bakaanga amachiiko ane ayio omonto karayabwate nabe moyo goetera ase aro. Bagasaria mono Chisabato chiane, bagachikora chikaba echitachenegeti. Erio ’nkarengereria kobaumorera endamwamu y’ane agwo ase erooro, ’mbasirie kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ayio nakorete nigo nayakorete ase okorenda erieta riane tirikorwa ribe eritachenegeti ase amasio y’ abanto b’ebisaku, abwo ase narusetie Abaisraeli korwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nkaria eira y’ogotiana agwo ase erooro ng’a tinkobaira ase ense eria konya nabaeire, ense entenenku ere n’amabeere na amooke, ense ere nobonene goetania chinse chinde chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nigo nayakorete, ekiagera baangete amachiiko ane, bakaanga kobwatia emeroberio y’ane echiikire; bagakora Chisabato chiane chikaba echitachenegeti. Chinkoro chiabo nigo chianchete emegwekano yabo barenge gosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nonya naboigo nkabarorera amaabera, gose tinabasiretie kegima agwo ase erooro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo n akuurerete abana babo agwo ase erooro, nkabateebia: Inwe timobaisa kobwatia emeroberio eyio chisokoro chiaino chiachiigete, gose timobaisa konara chingencho chiabo, gose timobaisa gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka ase ogosasiima emegwekano yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino; mobwatie emeroberio y’ane echiikire. Mobwatie amachiiko ane na koyakora!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morende Chisabato chiane chibe chinchenu, erinde chibe ekemanyererio ase egati y’ane nainwe; erio nario moranyare komanya ng’a inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende abana baria bagasaria asende; tibabwatetie emeroberio y’ane echiikire, na tibarendete amachiiko ane na tibayakorete, amachiiko ayio omonto orabwate abe moyo goetera asaro. Bagakora Chisabato chiane chikaba echitachenegeti. Erio nkarengereria kobaumorera ekeririanda kiane, erinde endamwamu y’ane eerere igoro yabo agwo ase erooro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tinakorete bo, ekiagera nigo narendete erieta riane tirikorwa ribe eritachenegeti ase amasio y’ abanto b’ebisaku abwo ase narusetie Abaisraeli korwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkaria eira y’ogotiana, agwo ase erooro, ng’a mbasiarere ase egati y’ebisaku, na kobaserebania gochia ase chinse chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo nakorete bo, ekiagera tibabwatete amachiiko ane na tibayakorerete, korende nigo baangete koigwera emeroberio y’ane echiikire, na bagakora Chisabato chiane chikaba echitachenegeti, na amaiso abo nigo arigereretie emegwekano eyio chisokoro chiabo chiarenge gosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erio ’nkabaa emeroberio echiikire etarenge emiya, na amachiiko atarenge kobarentera obogima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabatiga bagesoyia ase ogotacheneka goetera ase ebiegwa biabo, ’nkabatiga bagasamba abana babo bonsi abatangi bakaba ebing’wanso. Nigo nakorete ayio ase okobaondokia, banyare komanya ng’a inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, aye Mwanyabaanto, kwana n’Abaisraeli, obateebie ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Ase amang’ana ayio chisokoro chiaino nigo chiandamete ase ogotaba abegenwa asende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabarenta ase ense eyio nabarierete eira ng’a nimbayee. Na aase aande onsi barooche aimokererete igoro, gose emete yabwate chinsagia chinyinge, nao barenge koruera ebing’wanso biabo na okoruegwa konde, ebio biarenge okogechia asende. Aroro agwo bakaruera ebing’wanso bire ne rimisu rigiya, na bakaumora okoruegwa kwabo kw’ebinyugwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkababoria: Aase agwo aimokererete igoro ase mogochia naaki? Ase ayio, aase buna agwo nigo akorokwa Aase Aimokererete Igoro Agosasiimerwa, nabo akorokwa goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, teebia Abaisraeli ng’a aya naro Omonene akoboria: Inee! Nainwe nigo mwesoirie ase ogotacheneka ase okobwatia chingencho chie chisokoro chiaino na gokora obokaayayu ase ogosasiima emegwekano yabo y’okogechia?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya ngoika reero iga, ekero mokorua ebiegwa biaino, na gosamba abana baino babe ebing’wanso, nigo mogwesoyia ase ogotacheneka ase ogosasiima emegwekano yaino yonsi. Naende inwe Abaisraeli, Inee, ninyanchete momborie amang’ana? Ekeene buna inche inde moyo, tingwancha momborie. Ninche Omonene Nyasae nateebire ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana mokorengereria tagoikeranigwa nonya ng’ake, ekiagera nigo mogoteeba: Ntoganetie tobe buna abanto b’ebisaku binde na abe chinse chinde, tosasiime emete na amagena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae okorua egesusuro na amaabera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene Nyasae nigo agoteeba iga: Ekeene, buna inche inde moyo, nindambore okoboko kwane kore nokobua na ning’umore ekeririanda kiane, nimbe nkobagambera inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, ase okoboko kwane kore nokobua koramboire, na ase okoumora ekeririanda kiane, nimbarusie korwa ase abanto b’ebisaku, mbasangererie korwa ase chinse echio mwasiareretwe gochia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ’mbarente ase erooro y’ abanto b’ebisaku, na aroro agwo nimbanachere ekiina obosio ase obosio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbanachere inwe ekiina buna nanacherete chisokoro chiaino ekiina, agwo ase erooro y’ense ya Misiri. Nabo inche Omonene nateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimbaetie inwe inse y’enyimbo y’ane y’oborisia, ’mbasoyie ase egesibo gi’okobwatana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyatanane korwa ase more abatari koigwera, na abasaririe asende. Nimbarusie korwa ase ense eria bare abamenyi, korende barabwo tibagosoa ase ense y’Abaisraeli. Erio nario moramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya nar’Omonene akobateebia inwe Abaisraeli: Kera oyomo oino agenderere gosasiima omogwekano oye! Korende ase engaki eraache ekero morabe mokonyigwera timokora erieta riane richenu ribe eritachenegeti ase okorua ebiegwa biaino na gosasiima emegwekano yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: Agwo ase egetunwa kiane egechenu, egetunwa egetambe ki’Abaisraeli, nao Abaisraeli bonsi bare ase ense barabe bagonkorera. Aroro agwo nimbaanchere, na aroro agwo ninyanchere okoruegwa kwaino, na ebiegwa biaino bire ebiya mono, amo n’ebinto bionsi morabe mogwatanana bibe ebichenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ndabe nabarusirie korwa ase abanto b’ebisaku na kobasangereria korwa ase chinse echio nabasiarerete gochia, erio nimbanchere buna ogotioka kwe rimisu rigiya. Ase amasio y’ abanto b’ebisaku ninyeorokie ase more inde omochenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ndabarente ase ense y’Abaisraeli eyio nariete eira na gotiana ng’a nin’yee chisokoro chiaino, erio momanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ase ense eria ’namoinyore chinchera chiaino, na ogokora kwaino gwonsi, ase okwo mwabeire mogwesoyia ase ogotacheneka; inwe mwegeche abanyene ase engencho y’amabe onsi mwakorire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe Abaisraeli, ekero ndabakorere amaya ase engencho y’erieta riane, tinkobakorera koreng’ana ne chinchera chiaino chimbe, gose koreng’ana nogokora kwaino kw’obosareku; erio nario moramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene. Nabo Omonene ateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorero ase Irianyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha asende, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, rigereria gochia ensemo ya Irianyi, oyerarerie ring’ana rire mamincha yaye, na obaane igoro ye rinani ri’ense ya Negebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oteebie rinani ria Negebu iga: Igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene. Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Rora, nintongie omorero ime yao, n’oro nosambe osirie emete emebese, na emiomo yonsi. Omorero oyio ekebemberi tokorimigwa, na amasio y’ abanto bonsi korwa Irianyi goika sugusu nasambwe n’oro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi mbarore ng’a inche ninche Omonene nayotongirie, tokonyara korimigwa nonde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ngateeba, “Ayee, Omonene! Abanto aba nigo bagokwana igoro y’ane baboria: Inee! Omonto oyo tari gokwana ase emebayeno?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
